## ⚡ Quickstart
Clone a project and install dependencies (example):
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Quentin-Guillerey/csr-automation-toolkit.git
cd csr-automation-toolkit
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # or `.\.venv\Scripts\activate` on Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
# Update .env / config as needed, then:
flask run

💡 Typical Use Cases

Automating routine ticket triage and routing
Auto-summaries and suggested replies for CSRs
Knowledge base maintenance and relevance scoring
Compliance checks and data validation pipelines
